  "fairness_statement": "BiPO retains the official CAA-to-single-layer bidirectional shared-vector workflow and registered optimizer settings. Default candidate count is three; ConFiQA overrides it with ceil(L/3) under its dated budget amendment. Data roles remain shared with the corresponding methods. This is a project budget adaptation, not an official BiPO recommendation or a claim of equal full-pipeline compute. Candidate layer, multiplier, and seed are not searched as a Cartesian product."
